{
  "$type": "GPMAutomateEditor.Models.SubEditor, GPMAutomateEditor.Models",
  "body": {
    "$type": "GPMAutomateEditor.Models.NormalBlockNode, GPMAutomateEditor.Models",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "$type": "GPMAutomateEditor.Models.NormalBlockNode, GPMAutomateEditor.Models",
        "nodes": [],
        "expanded": true,
        "continue_on_error": false,
        "id": "e0e3d596-9beb-4ce3-90a2-0c4a44f70423",
        "display_text": "Normal block",
        "raw_input": null,
        "comment": "GHI CHÚ FLOW 0 V3\n- Thao tác chính: tìm nút Home bằng ảnh `img_9.img64` (nguồn: `D:\\capture\\symbol_home.png`). Có tọa độ thì ghi `HOME_ICON_FOUND`, touch tọa độ đó và chờ 5 giây; không có thì ghi `HOME_ICON_NOT_FOUND`.\n- Biến kết quả `homePos` nằm ở Block `Find and touch Home by image` → node `Image search`.\n- Chỉ touch khi `homePos` không rỗng, nên không chạm vào tọa độ rỗng.\n- Cách đếm: dùng số thứ tự node/block hiển thị trong GPM Automate, tính cả block ghi chú này."
      },
      {
        "$type": "GPMAutomateEditor.Models.NormalBlockNode, GPMAutomateEditor.Models",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "$type": "GPMAutomateEditor.Models.ActionNode, GPMAutomateEditor.Models",
            "type": 33,
            "element_xpath": null,
            "output_variable_name": "homePos",
            "delay": "0,0",
            "continue_on_error": false,
            "id": "0a9a50dc-9492-4e0b-8ba1-0ae190f0747b",
            "display_text": "Image search",
            "raw_input": "[{\"Key\":\"IMG\",\"Value\":\"img_9.img64\"},{\"Key\":\"THRESH_HOLD\",\"Value\":\"0.8\"},{\"Key\":\"TRUE_COLOR\",\"Value\":\"No\"}]",
            "comment": "find Home position by image"
          },
          {
            "$type": "GPMAutomateEditor.Models.IfBlockNode, GPMAutomateEditor.Models",
            "condition": "$homePos != \"\"",
            "nodes": [
              {
                "$type": "GPMAutomateEditor.Models.ActionNode, GPMAutomateEditor.Models",
                "type": 1,
                "element_xpath": null,
                "output_variable_name": "homeResult",
                "delay": "0,0",
                "continue_on_error": false,
                "id": "b2360e30-8076-48a0-995c-5c87a829f3d9",
                "display_text": "Set variable",
                "raw_input": "[{\"Key\":\"VALUE\",\"Value\":\"HOME_ICON_FOUND\"},{\"Key\":\"ALLOW_USER_INPUT\",\"Value\":\"False\"},{\"Key\":\"USER_INPUT_TYPE\",\"Value\":\"Text\"},{\"Key\":\"COMBOBOX_DATA\",\"Value\":\"\"},{\"Key\":\"INPUT_REQUIRED\",\"Value\":\"False\"}]",
                "comment": "log Home icon found"
              },
              {
                "$type": "GPMAutomateEditor.Models.ActionNode, GPMAutomateEditor.Models",
                "type": 107,
                "element_xpath": null,
                "output_variable_name": null,
                "delay": "0,0",
                "continue_on_error": false,
                "id": "2fefb446-902c-4736-81ee-6441ad36c507",
                "display_text": "Touch",
                "raw_input": "[{\"Key\":\"TOUCH_TYPE\",\"Value\":\"TOUCH_POS\"},{\"Key\":\"XPATH\",\"Value\":\"\"},{\"Key\":\"POS\",\"Value\":\"$homePos\"},{\"Key\":\"MODE\",\"Value\":\"Normal\"}]",
                "comment": "touch Home image position"
              },
              {
                "$type": "GPMAutomateEditor.Models.ActionNode, GPMAutomateEditor.Models",
                "type": 7,
                "element_xpath": null,
                "output_variable_name": null,
                "delay": "0,0",
                "continue_on_error": false,
                "id": "6a181b5f-4879-4f31-ae37-88fc0374fe7d",
                "display_text": "Delay",
                "raw_input": "[{\"Key\":\"MIN\",\"Value\":\"5000\"},{\"Key\":\"MAX\",\"Value\":\"5000\"}]",
                "comment": "wait after Home touch"
              }
            ],
            "expanded": true,
            "continue_on_error": false,
            "id": "ba081ff6-9478-40c4-99a7-c01e3da63b45",
            "display_text": "If",
            "raw_input": "[{\"Key\":\"CONDITION\",\"Value\":\"$homePos != \\\"\\\"\"}]",
            "comment": "Home image position found"
          },
          {
            "$type": "GPMAutomateEditor.Models.ElseBlockNode, GPMAutomateEditor.Models",
            "nodes": [
              {
                "$type": "GPMAutomateEditor.Models.ActionNode, GPMAutomateEditor.Models",
                "type": 1,
                "element_xpath": null,
                "output_variable_name": "homeResult",
                "delay": "0,0",
                "continue_on_error": false,
                "id": "8927ff41-2700-4288-af64-6d0aa3c4535c",
                "display_text": "Set variable",
                "raw_input": "[{\"Key\":\"VALUE\",\"Value\":\"HOME_ICON_NOT_FOUND\"},{\"Key\":\"ALLOW_USER_INPUT\",\"Value\":\"False\"},{\"Key\":\"USER_INPUT_TYPE\",\"Value\":\"Text\"},{\"Key\":\"COMBOBOX_DATA\",\"Value\":\"\"},{\"Key\":\"INPUT_REQUIRED\",\"Value\":\"False\"}]",
                "comment": "log Home icon not found"
              }
            ],
            "expanded": true,
            "continue_on_error": false,
            "id": "4b28c496-4867-42ae-b371-8d7ece0e59ee",
            "display_text": "Else",
            "raw_input": null,
            "comment": "Home image position not found"
          }
        ],
        "expanded": true,
        "continue_on_error": false,
        "id": "ed078b45-18b9-4ac4-8c89-9a0a7c2b892e",
        "display_text": "Normal block",
        "raw_input": null,
        "comment": "Find and touch Home by image"
      }
    ],
    "expanded": true,
